1.In a network of multiple services, for any service-service communication via APIs, Circuit Breaker should open the circuit and API should failfast if the API error count for last X minutes >= Y. ( 10 minutes and 3 times) [No half open, only open and close] 2.The circuit breaker should be closed and the service should start receiving requests after a cool off period of Z minutes. 3.How can we make this implementation thread-safe ?




